<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Convite Apaixonado ❤️</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      background-color: #cc0000;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .container {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 3rem;
      border-radius: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #fff0f0;
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #ffe6e6;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 2rem;
      animation: pulse 1s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.3); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }

    .buttons {
      position: relative;
      height: 80px;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 30px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .yes {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #cc0000;
    }

    .no {
      background-color: #ffcccc;
      color: #660000;
      position: absolute;
    }

    .floating-hearts {
      position: fixed;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .floating-hearts span {
      position: absolute;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #ffcccc;
      animation: float 6s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(100vh) scale(0.5);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      100% {
        transform: translateY(-10vh) scale(1);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="floating-hearts">
    <script>
      for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {
        const heart = document.createElement("span");
        heart.innerHTML = "❤️";
        heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
        heart.style.animationDelay = Math.random() * 5 + "s";
        document.querySelector('.floating-hearts').appendChild(heart);
      }
    </script>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="heart">❤️❤️❤️</div>
    <h1>Gustavo, aceita ir ao show do Froid?</h1>
    <p>Prometo que esse vai ser mais um daqueles momentos nossos, cheio de significado e boiola💕</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <button class="btn yes" onclick="alert('E ele aceitouuu!!!! te amo😍')">Sim!</button>
      <button class="btn no" id="noBtn">Não</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const noBtn = document.getElementById("noBtn");

    noBtn.addEventListener("mouseover", () => {
      const parent = noBtn.parentElement;
      const containerWidth = parent.offsetWidth;
      const containerHeight = parent.offsetHeight;
      const newX = Math.random() * (containerWidth - noBtn.offsetWidth);
      const newY = Math.random() * (containerHeight - noBtn.offsetHeight);

      noBtn.style.left = `${newX}px`;
      noBtn.style.top = `${newY}px`;
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
